
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║         EasyEDA WebSocket Bridge Server                      ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                              ║
║  Port:        49620                                          ║
║  Port Range:  49620-49629                                  ║
║  Service ID:  easyeda-bridge                              ║
║                                                              ║
║  HTTP API:    http://localhost:49620                         ║
║  WS (EDA):   ws://localhost:49620/eda                       ║
║  WS (Agent): ws://localhost:49620/agent                     ║
║                                                              ║
║  Endpoints:                                                  ║
║    GET  /health     - 健康检查 & EDA 连接状态                ║
║    POST /execute    - 执行代码 {"code": "..."}               ║
║                                                              ║
║  Handshake:                                                  ║
║    /health returns { service: "easyeda-bridge" }       ║
║    WS sends { type: "handshake", service: "..." }            ║
║                                                              ║
